This repository vendors CSS from the Digital Agency Design System (DADS)
example components:

    https://github.com/digital-go-jp/design-system-example-components-html
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 デジタル庁 (Digital Agency, Government of Japan)

The vendored file is resources/jp_go_dds/dds.css; its header records the exact
upstream commit and is regenerated by `kbb --backend sci scripts/vendor.cljk` rather than
edited by hand. The upstream licence text is preserved verbatim in
LICENSE-upstream.

The kotoba-lang code in this repository (the cljc hiccup library) is original
work. It is offered under the same MIT terms as the vendored CSS so that the
repository carries a single licence, rather than the Apache-2.0 used across the
rest of the kotoba-lang organization.
